conjectured that if n = 6k + 1 or 6k + 3 there exists a system of triplets of n elements so that every pair is contained in one and only one triplet (if n is not of the above form it is easy to see that such a system can not exist) . STEINER'S conjecture was first proved by REISS and later independently by MOORE . 

